==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page two of the [[Dust Devils Premium Warbond#Page 2|Dust Devils]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

